msgstr "&U ovu vrijednost:"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:426
#, kde-format
msgid "Do not show (&gag) the line"
msgstr "Ne prikazuj (&priguši) red"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:427
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will prevent the matched line from being displayed in the output window."
msgstr "Ovo će spriječiti da se poklopljeni red prikaže u izlaznom prozoru."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:429
#, kde-format
msgid "&Notify"
msgstr "Ob&avijesti"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:430
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This setting only takes effect if you have disabled the \"Always notify\" "
"option in Global settings and at least one of global/local notification is "
"enabled. It will activate notification if the KMuddy window and/or this "
"session is not active at the moment.\n"
"Useful if you only want to be notified of some events (tells, combat, ...)."
msgstr ""
"Ova postavka stupa na snagu samo ako ste u globalnim postavkama isključili "
"opciju „Uvijek obavještavaj“ i ako je uključeno bar jedno od globalnog i "
"lokalnog obavještavanja. Obavještenje će se aktivirati ako prozor KMuddy‑ja "
"i/ili ova sesija trenutno nisu aktivni.\n"
"Korisno ako želite obavještenja samo o nekim događajima (šaputanja, "
"borba...)."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:437
#, kde-format
msgid "&Prompt-detection trigger"
msgstr "Okidač za prepoznavanje pro&mpta"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:438
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Enabling this will turn this trigger into a prompt detection trigger, that "
"is, text will be passed to these triggers even if no newline was received, "
"the text will be displayed as a prompt if the trigger gets matched, and most "
"other options will NOT be taken into effect - prompt-detect trigger cannot "
"send out text, gag lines, do notification. Colorization is still possible."
msgstr ""
"Uključivanjem ovoga okidač postaje okidač za prepoznavanje prompta, tj. "
"tekst će se prosljeđivati ovim okidačima i ako nije primljen novi red, tekst "
"će biti prikazan kao prompt ako ga okidač poklopi, a većina ostalih opcija "
"NEĆE imati dejstva — okidač za prepoznavanje prompta ne može da šalje tekst, "
"prigušuje redove niti obavještava. Bojenje je i dalje moguće."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:444
#, kde-format
msgid "Play s&ound file"
msgstr "Pusti zvučni &fajl"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:445
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This trigger will play a sound. Useful as a notification of important "
"events, or to assign sounds to some events."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj okidač će pustiti zvuk. Korisno za obavještenje o važnim događajima ili "
"za pridruživanje zvukova nekim događajima."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:464
#, kde-format
msgid "Send output to a separate window"
msgstr "Pošalji izlaz u zaseban prozor"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:465
#, kde-format
msgid "This will send the matched text to a separate output window"
msgstr "Ovo će poslati poklopljeni tekst u zaseban izlazni prozor"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:467 kmuddy/dialogs/dlgwindows.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid "Output Windows"
msgstr "Izlazni prozori"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:478
#, kde-format
msgid "&Gag output in main window"
msgstr "&Priguši izlaz u glavnom prozoru"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:479
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This will cause output sent to a separate window not to be displayed in main "
"KMuddy session window"
msgstr ""
"Ovim se izlaz poslat u zaseban prozor neće prikazivati u glavnom prozoru "
"sesije KMuddy‑ja"

